QModem Advance Modem Settings: Chinese and Russian for the new strings

Patch 0012 added 75 strings to Advance Modem Settings (the cell list, the lock form, saved
cells, auto-refresh, the auto-unlock switch, the Set IMEI and Reboot Modem help), and two of
the page's older strings ("Scan", "-- custom ---") were never translated. luci-app-qmodem ships
zh_Hans, zh-cn (an identical copy) and ru catalogs; none had them.

The 77 entries are appended to each of the three files with a "#: CleanWRT" source note. The
page builds some sentences from pieces around a number ("Unlock when the cell is lost for" N
"minutes"), and those pieces are translated to read in that order. Every file still compiles
with po2lmo; the duplicate entries msgfmt reports were already in the upstream files, and none
is added. The translations were written for CleanWRT, not by native speakers; fixes are
welcome.

Applies to: https://github.com/FUjr/QModem.git @ 0988085b, after 0013.
Upstream status: local to CleanWRT.

